    {
      "inscription": "[Under the surface of the platter the engraved signature]: “FAIT-PAR-I-A-MEISSONIER-ARCHITECTTE”; [and the weight] “673=5\"; “No. [v] I 50 £ b76Sol”; [and the numbers] “A nº 1”; “A nº2”",
